 "words": 186,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "My legs are burning, my lungs are on fire",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The road is long and the hill is higher",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.47,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But I can hear them cheering from the stands",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.18,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones who ran before me with their open hands",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 3.71,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Since we are surrounded by such a great cloud of witnesses",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 6.09,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let us throw off every weight",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And let us run with endurance the race set before us",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.71,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Fixing our eyes on Jesus",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 9.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Abraham and Moses, Rahab at the wall",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 14.14,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They didn't see the finish but they gave it all",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 15.42,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the baton's in my hand and the time is now",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 12.68,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm going to run this race, I'm going to show you how",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 12.96,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Since we are surrounded by such a great cloud of witnesses",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 15.09,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let us throw off every weight",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 15.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And let us run with endurance the race set before us",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 14.69,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Fixing our eyes on Jesus",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 15.87,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The pioneer and perfecter of faith",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 22.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who for the joy set before him endured the cross",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 23.47,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Scorning its shame",
   "heard": 3,
